WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.291 --> 00:00:48.208
In these verses, Lord Krishna compares

2
00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:51.250
the temporary nature of the material world

3
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.208
with the eternal and indestructible nature

4
00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:55.916
of His supreme abode.

5
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:03.083
Lord Krishna describes both

6
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:05.791
the manifest and unmanifest
 aspects of the material world,

7
00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:08.875
and then speaks of a separate divine realm.

8
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:12.333
He explains that beyond this temporary world,

9
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:15.208
there exists another nature –

10
00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.041
one that is eternal and beyond destruction.

11
00:01:17.041 --> 00:01:19.708
This is referred to as

12
00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:23.625
‘paras tasmāt tu bhāvo’nyo.’

13
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:25.708
This spiritual nature is entirely different

14
00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:27.583
from the endless cycle

15
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:31.083
of creation and dissolution

16
00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:33.083
experienced within the material universe.

17
00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:34.625
In the material world,

18
00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:37.416
everything eventually ends.

19
00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:41.125
But the spiritual realm remains unchanged

20
00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:44.458
and untouched by time.

21
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:46.000
Lord Krishna says His supreme abode

22
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.458
is ‘avyakto’kṣara’ –

23
00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:52.666
unmanifest and completely free from defect.

24
00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:55.666
Here, unmanifest does not mean formless,

25
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:57.083
but rather something

26
00:01:57.083 --> 00:02:00.166
that is beyond our material perception.

27
00:02:00.166 --> 00:02:01.500
Although the spiritual world

28
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.708
cannot be experienced

29
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:04.833
through the senses,

30
00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:08.000
it is real and eternal.

31
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.125
Lord Krishna assures us that those
 who reach this supreme destination –

32
00:02:11.125 --> 00:02:14.250
paramāṃ gatim –

33
00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.541
never return to the cycle

34
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:19.333
of birth and death.

35
00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:20.750
By highlighting the difference between 

36
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.083
the temporary material world

37
00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:25.083
and the eternal spiritual realm,

38
00:02:25.083 --> 00:02:27.750
Lord Krishna firmly declares that His

39
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:31.333
supreme abode is the final destination.

40
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:32.625
In the coming verses,

41
00:02:32.625 --> 00:02:35.666
He will shed further light

42
00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:37.291
on the path to reach this supreme destination.

43
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:45.833
Have you ever wondered

44
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:52.083
what happens after death?

45
00:02:52.083 --> 00:02:58.666
Death often frightens us

46
00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:03.375
because it seems like an end –

47
00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:06.583
an unknown void.

48
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.166
But understand this –

49
00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:14.000
what lies beyond death

50
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.916
is far more beautiful,

51
00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:21.333
far more wondrous.

52
00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:24.125
In My supreme abode,

53
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:30.708
there is no place for fear or loss.

54
00:03:30.708 --> 00:03:33.875
It is a realm of eternal joy

55
00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:36.625
and love.

56
00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:39.375
Just as grass withers in summer –

57
00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:41.875
its greenness

58
00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:45.833
fades away.

59
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:48.666
But when the rains arrive,

60
00:03:48.666 --> 00:03:52.500
the earth clothes itself

61
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.625
in fresh green

62
00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:58.833
once more.

63
00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:01.250
In the same way,

64
00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.833
death is not an end –

65
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:08.083
it is a new beginning.

66
00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:10.416
When you see death

67
00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.333
as a transition,

68
00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:16.000
meaning transformative,

69
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.583
or as an invitation to fulfill

70
00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:23.875
a greater purpose,

71
00:04:23.875 --> 00:04:27.625
you stop fearing it

72
00:04:27.625 --> 00:04:32.291
and begin to prepare for it willingly.

73
00:04:32.291 --> 00:04:35.125
Your material form,

74
00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:39.291
with all its attachments and desires,

75
00:04:39.291 --> 00:04:42.166
keeps you bound to this temporary world –

76
00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:45.333
much exactly like

77
00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:51.000
a dreaming mind caught in illusions

78
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:55.916
that does not want to leave that virtual world.

79
00:04:55.916 --> 00:05:00.625
But your spiritual form –

80
00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:04.083
your true form –

81
00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:09.208
draws you toward that divine realm

82
00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:11.125
where there is no pain

83
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:14.791
or decay.

84
00:05:14.791 --> 00:05:16.541
So therefore,

85
00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:19.916
instead of fearing death,

86
00:05:19.916 --> 00:05:22.250
accept it as a

87
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.750
natural part of your journey.

88
00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:30.416
Focus on living in a way

89
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:35.500
that is aligned with your spiritual nature.

90
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.666
Engage in practices

91
00:05:38.666 --> 00:05:43.500
that connect you to Me.

92
00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.000
Gradually, you will find

93
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.166
that your heart begins

94
00:05:48.166 --> 00:05:53.291
to long for that eternal realm.

95
00:05:53.291 --> 00:05:54.958
Then

96
00:05:54.958 --> 00:05:59.333
death becomes not an end, but

97
00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:04.416
a doorway to the supreme destination.

98
00:06:04.416 --> 00:06:07.083
Let go of fear.

99
00:06:07.083 --> 00:06:09.791
Stay rooted in faith.

100
00:06:09.791 --> 00:06:15.000
And await the joy

101
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:19.666
and peace that await you in My supreme abode.

102
00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:27.000
In family life,

103
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.916
you may try to imagine

104
00:06:30.916 --> 00:06:32.875
what the spiritual world

105
00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:35.250
looks like.

106
00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:38.541
Television and films

107
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:41.791
give you some impressions,

108
00:06:41.791 --> 00:06:44.208
but remember –

109
00:06:44.208 --> 00:06:46.375
none of them

110
00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:50.666
are truly accurate.

111
00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:52.666
The spiritual world

112
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:55.333
is made of various energies,

113
00:06:55.333 --> 00:06:59.458
that are completely beyond anything

114
00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:01.250
you have ever experienced

115
00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.541
or felt in this world.

116
00:07:05.541 --> 00:07:08.291
Using material logic

117
00:07:08.291 --> 00:07:12.083
and trying to understand that divine realm

118
00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:15.625
is like comparing the pleasure of eating a meal

119
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:18.833
to the joy

120
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:22.708
of receiving a priceless diamond.

121
00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:26.125
Understanding the spiritual world with 

122
00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:28.500
material intelligence is extremely difficult.

123
00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.666
The spiritual world

124
00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:33.458
is not just another version of this world.

125
00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:36.000
It is an entirely

126
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.000
unique realm –

127
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:42.125
where My eternal presence

128
00:07:42.125 --> 00:07:44.666
fills every moment with joy

129
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:47.500
and love.

130
00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:51.125
So instead of relying on your
 limited understanding,

131
00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:55.541
listen to the descriptions given in the Gita.

132
00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:57.708
Listen to the descriptions.

133
00:07:57.708 --> 00:07:59.250
These teachings

134
00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.125
share with your family.

135
00:08:02.125 --> 00:08:04.958
Use these teachings as a guide

136
00:08:04.958 --> 00:08:08.041
to fulfill your spiritual aspirations.

137
00:08:08.041 --> 00:08:12.000
Use them as a guide.

138
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:15.250
The more you listen to these words

139
00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:18.333
and reflect on them,

140
00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:23.125
the closer you come to
 understanding the beauty

141
00:08:23.125 --> 00:08:26.666
and truth of My eternal abode.

142
00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:32.083
As this inner strength of knowledge grows,

143
00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:35.250
the entire family begins to 
move on the spiritual path

144
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:39.208
in the right direction,

145
00:08:39.208 --> 00:08:42.958
at the right pace,

146
00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:45.875
leading everyone together

147
00:08:45.875 --> 00:08:49.375
toward the supreme abode.

148
00:08:54.458 --> 00:08:58.000
At the workplace, very few people have

149
00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.041
the courage to speak the truth

150
00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:02.500
Tell me,

151
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.250
isn't that so?

152
00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:09.083
In your professional life,

153
00:09:09.083 --> 00:09:11.250
there are times

154
00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.166
when with the genuine intention
 of helping others

155
00:09:14.166 --> 00:09:16.375
you openly share your knowledge and skills

156
00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:18.625
with them.

157
00:09:18.625 --> 00:09:20.166
And yet,

158
00:09:20.166 --> 00:09:24.000
some people may misread your intent

159
00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.708
and accuse you of self-promotion

160
00:09:26.708 --> 00:09:31.166
or exaggeration.

161
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:34.083
In the same way, when I

162
00:09:34.083 --> 00:09:38.125
describe My supreme abode and My qualities,

163
00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:41.916
some may feel envious,

164
00:09:41.916 --> 00:09:43.375
thinking

165
00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:48.500
that I am boasting about Myself.

166
00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.250
But I,

167
00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.916
I am simply speaking the truth

168
00:09:54.916 --> 00:09:57.833
and to experience it yourself, I am

169
00:09:57.833 --> 00:09:59.833
inviting you.

170
00:09:59.833 --> 00:10:03.000
A tree does not take pride in bearing fruit,

171
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.416
but rather equally

172
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:10.708
offers its fruit to all.

173
00:10:10.708 --> 00:10:13.791
In the same way, a wise person

174
00:10:13.791 --> 00:10:16.041
the fruit of their knowledge

175
00:10:16.041 --> 00:10:22.750
is always ready to share with everyone equally.

176
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.708
In your work,

177
00:10:24.708 --> 00:10:28.458
you may face situations

178
00:10:28.458 --> 00:10:29.791
where others

179
00:10:29.791 --> 00:10:34.250
misjudge your intentions.

180
00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.875
They may think

181
00:10:35.875 --> 00:10:39.250
that you are seeking praise,

182
00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:42.916
while you are genuinely trying to help

183
00:10:42.916 --> 00:10:46.791
and guide them.

184
00:10:46.791 --> 00:10:52.500
Even then – keep helping others.

185
00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.000
Your role

186
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.458
is not to convince everyone of your selfless

187
00:10:56.458 --> 00:10:59.916
true intentions,

188
00:10:59.916 --> 00:11:01.583
but rather

189
00:11:01.583 --> 00:11:02.916
your skills

190
00:11:02.916 --> 00:11:06.541
and knowledge to offer them there

191
00:11:06.541 --> 00:11:10.916
where they can bring positive change.

192
00:11:10.916 --> 00:11:15.291
By staying focused on your
 true purpose of helping,

193
00:11:15.291 --> 00:11:20.250
you remain steady.

194
00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:24.083
Over time, those with open minds

195
00:11:24.083 --> 00:11:27.458
will recognize your sincerity

196
00:11:27.458 --> 00:11:31.625
and benefit from your guidance.

197
00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:34.541
Be patient.

198
00:11:34.541 --> 00:11:36.916
Even the sages

199
00:11:36.916 --> 00:11:39.291
for their knowledge

200
00:11:39.291 --> 00:11:41.916
faced harsh criticism,

201
00:11:41.916 --> 00:11:43.166
yet

202
00:11:43.166 --> 00:11:46.958
they never stopped spreading the truth.

203
00:11:46.958 --> 00:11:48.291
You too –

204
00:11:48.291 --> 00:11:52.750
keep giving your best, because

205
00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:57.416
the fruit of pure action is certain to come –

206
00:11:57.416 --> 00:12:00.166
whether in this life,

207
00:12:00.166 --> 00:12:02.375
or the next.
